# Design system

- Colors, radius, and shadows come from CSS variables. Do not hardcode hex values in components.
- Use `font-display` for headings and `font-sans` for interface text.
- Extend variants with `class-variance-authority` on Button, Card, Badge, Input, Section, and Container.
- Theme switching uses `next-themes` with the `class` attribute. Do not rely on `prefers-color-scheme` alone.
- Interactive controls need visible focus rings and accessible names.
